  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Research.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the Danish support to development research, Danida is supporting a number of international research institutions including Africa Economic Research Consortium (AERC), Council for the Development of Social Science Research in Africa (CODESRIA), Organisation for Social Science Research in Eastern and Southern Africa (OSSREA), and the World Institute for Development Economics Research under the United Nations University (UNU-WIDER). The purpose of the support to international research institutions is to stimulate the production of research results that may assist in addressing development challenges in Danida&#xbf;s priority countries, as well as to build up research capacity in the South within the field of social and natural science. Denmark is coordinating the support to international research institutions with the Nordic countries (Sweden, Norway and Finland), as the Nordic countries are supporting several of the same research institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
